; `other` is a *declared* form outside the `event` head-set. A form reaches
; only the `event` alternative of `note-or-event` — `note-or-rest` is a
; symbol kind — so `event` is the determined arm and the slot reports its
; own failure (15). Emitted identically on the tree and binary validation
; paths, through the binary form funnel.
(diagnostics
  (diagnostic :code not_head_member :path [track ev]))
